  "rationale": "No patched version is published and stable builder releases retain Get3. Read-only source shows Got cache defaults to undefined and cacheable-request is used only for truthy options.cache; callers may enable it. That is conditional source evidence, not proof of runtime exclusion. A bare Get5 override is incompatible; a reviewed consumer migration remains a separate clean-remediation route.",
